.\n\nIn this single-player adventure (with multiplayer modes coming soon), you'll navigate your RC spaceship to hit the ball and score goals. The game\u2019s physics-driven mechanics demand skill, precision, and creativity as you take full advantage of the gravity-free environment where walls are part of the strategy.\n\nFeaturing:\n- Tabletop Mixed Reality Gameplay: Immerse yourself in a hovering arena you can place anywhere.\n- Physics-Based Action: Perfect your spaceship control and dominate with strategic moves.\n- 3 Difficulty Levels: Progress through increasing challenges and sharpen your skills.\n- Weekly Leaderboards: Compete to secure the top spot against other players.\n- Upcoming Multiplayer Modes: Online and local multiplayer will let you battle friends in the same space or from across the world.\n\nWhether you love RC vehicles, soccer, or cutting-edge mixed reality gaming, Supersonic League is an experience you won\u2019t want to miss. Will you rise to the top and claim your spot as a Supersonic champion?", "short_description": "Take control of an RC spaceship in a gravity-free mixed reality arena right in your room! Compete against bots, master the physics-based gameplay, and climb the weekly leaderboards in Supersonic League."}]}, "developer_name": "XR Vision", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "http://xrvision.eu/supersonicleague/privacy-policy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "XR Vision", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "http://xrvision.eu/supersonicleague", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "2776542286000603"}, {"id": "1676485315806614"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_proc